    <li><strong>DeepSeek</strong> — AI pair programmer. Much of the code, tests and documentation
    was written with DeepSeek in the loop, and DeepSeek is the model behind the optional
    assistant.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="copyright">Copyright and licences</h2>
<p>Each file carries its copyright and licence in SPDX tags, and <code>make license-check</code>
checks them. The site's own source is MIT licensed, the rocket icon is ISC licensed, and the
third-party software the site ships is under the BSD licences.</p>
<p>The texts themselves are on <a href="/admin/copyright">Copyright and licences</a>, which is
written from the licence files this build carries rather than from a copy on this page, so the two
cannot disagree.</p>
